[2025-11-19 21:03:19] Datos recibidos: {"General information":{"UUID":"81a3af15-9f78-4bff-b25c-a9a05e048d43","Name":"market for natural gas liquids","Category":"Utilities\/221 Utilities","Description":"This is a market activity representing the consumption mix of natural gas liquids in the Global geography. The market connects suppliers with consumers of the same product in the same geographical area, grouping producers and imports within the Global region. The activity starts at the gate of the activities that produce natural gas liquids within the Global geography and ends with the supply of natural gas liquids to consumers. Transport or losses are considered irrelevant for this product. Natural gas liquids is a fossil fuel with a calorific value of 24.624 MJ\/kg, used as a liquid fuel sourced from unprocessed natural gas. Main applications include domestic fuel for cooking and heating, industrial fuel, and plastics raw material.","Tags":"market activity, natural gas liquids, fossil fuel, energy market, global supply chain","Technology | Description":"Market activity technology representing the aggregation and distribution network for natural gas liquids. The technology groups multiple producers and imports within the Global geography to create a consumption mix, connecting suppliers with consumers without additional transport or losses since these are considered irrelevant for the delivered product.","Code":"GLO","Last_change":"19\/11\/2025 21:02"},"location":{"@type":"Location","@id":"56bca136-90bb-3a77-9abb-7ce558af711e","name":"Global","description":"reference location, sources:  ecoinvent 3, ILCD, GaBi","version":"00.00.000","code":"GLO","latitude":0,"longitude":0},"processDocumentation":{"LCI method":"Allocation, cut-off system model","Process type":"Market activity","Modeling constants":"Valid for the entire period 2000-01-01 to 2024-12-31","Data source information":"ecoinvent 3.11 database","Data completeness":"Complete coverage of all relevant flows for m