ural gas liquids is a fossil fuel with calorific value of 24.624 MJ\/kg, used as liquid fuel sourced from unprocessed natural gas."}],"Outputs":[{"is_reference":true,"flow":"natural gas liquids","category":"","amount":1,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":null,"description":"This is the market for 'natural gas liquids', in the Global geography. It is a fossil fuel used as a liquid fuel and is sourced from unprocessed natural gas."}]}
