[2025-11-19 21:15:43] Datos recibidos: {"General information":{"UUID":"828d9772-e883-48ef-aed0-e885158d6d20","Name":"market for carbon monoxide - US - carbon monoxide","Category":"Manufactura\/3251 Fabricaci\u00f3n de productos qu\u00edmicos b\u00e1sicos","Description":"Esta es una actividad de mercado. Cada mercado representa la mezcla de consumo de un producto en una geograf\u00eda determinada, conectando proveedores con consumidores del mismo producto en la misma \u00e1rea geogr\u00e1fica. Los mercados agrupan a los productores y tambi\u00e9n las importaciones del producto (si son relevantes) dentro de la misma \u00e1rea geogr\u00e1fica. Tambi\u00e9n contabilizan el transporte al consumidor y las p\u00e9rdidas durante ese proceso, cuando es relevante. Este es el mercado para 'mon\u00f3xido de carbono', en la geograf\u00eda de Estados Unidos para consumo directo. Este producto generalmente se considera un producto intermedio y, como tal, se espera que se utilice en o en las inmediaciones del sitio de producci\u00f3n. El mon\u00f3xido de carbono es una sustancia inorg\u00e1nica con CAS no.: 000630-08-0. Se llama 'mon\u00f3xido de carbono' bajo la nomenclatura IUPAC y su f\u00f3rmula molecular es: CO. Es un gas en condiciones normales de temperatura y presi\u00f3n sin olor distintivo. Se modela como una sustancia pura. A nivel de consumidor, se utiliza en los siguientes productos: productos qu\u00edmicos de laboratorio, combustibles, productos para el tratamiento de superficies met\u00e1licas, pol\u00edmeros y semiconductores. No hay informaci\u00f3n disponible p\u00fablicamente sobre el consumo de esta sustancia en sitios industriales.","Tags":"mercado, mon\u00f3xido de carbono, productos qu\u00edmicos b\u00e1sicos, sustancias inorg\u00e1nicas, gases industriales","Technology | Description":"Actividad de mercado que representa la mezcla de consumo del mon\u00f3xido de carbono en Estados Unidos. El producto se considera un producto intermedio utilizado en las inmediaciones del sitio de producci\u00f3n. No se incluyen requisitos de transporte ya que el producto generalmente se utiliza en o cerca del sitio de producci\u00f3n. La actividad comienza cuando el producto sale del sitio de producci\u00f3n y termina cuando llega al usuario.","Code":"US","Last_change":"19\/11\/2025 21:14"},"location":{"@type":"Location","@id":"0b3b97fa-6688-3c56-88ee-4ae80ec0c3c2","name":"United States","description":"reference location, sources: ISO 3166-1, ecoinvent 3, ILCD, GaBi","version":"00.00.000","code":"US","latitude":39.622,"longitude":-98.606},"processDocumentation":{"LCI method":"Allocation, cut-off system model","Process type":"Market activity","Modeling constants":"Product is generally considered an intermediate product and expected to be used at or in the vicinity of the production site. No transport requirements are included as product is used on or in close vicinity to production site.","Data source information":"ecoinvent 3.11 database","Data completeness":"Covers all relevant flows for carbon monoxide market in United States geography","Data selection":"Includes suppliers and imports of carbon monoxide within the same geographical area. Accounts for transport to consumer and losses when relevant.","Data treatment":"Market activity representing consumption mix of carbon monoxide in United States geography","Sampling procedure":"Not specified in provided documentation","Data collection period":"2011-01-01 to 2024-12-31","Use advice":"Valid for direct consumption of carbon monoxide in United States geography. Product is generally considered an intermediate product used at or in vicinity of production site.","Completeness":"Complete for market representation of carbon monoxide in United States","Sources":"ecoinvent Association","Project":"ecoinvent database","Intended application":"Life cycle assessment studies requiring carbon monoxide inventory data for United States market","Data set owner":"ecoinvent Association","Data set generator":"lasonas loannou","Data set documentor":"lasonas loannou","Publication":"ecoinvent 3.11 database documentation","Creation date":"2025","Copyright":"Copyright ecoinvent Association, 2025","Access and use restrictions":"Restrictions of use stipulated in the EULA remain applicable"},"actors":{"@id":"47a88430-1dd2-4569-9741-8249a6672ae2","name":"IINGEN-UNAM","description":"Instituto de Ingenier\u00eda de la UNAM","category":"Organizaciones de investigaci\u00f3n","version":"01.00.000","lastChange":"2025-11-19T21:15:07.612Z","address":"Circuito Escolar s\/n, Ciudad Universitaria","city":"Coyoac\u00e1n","zipCode":"04510","country":"MX","email":"APadillaR@iingen.unam.mx","telephone":"+52 5556233600","telefax":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.iingen.unam.mx"},"Inputs":[{"is_reference":false,"flow":"carbon monoxide","category":"","amount":0.5,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"","provider":"carbon monoxide production, from synthesis gas, through absorption US - carbon monoxide","description":""},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"carbon monoxide","category":"","amount":0.5,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"","provider":"carbon monoxide production, from synthesis gas, through cryogenic separation US - carbon monoxide","description":""}],"Outputs":[{"is_reference":true,"flow":"carbon monoxide","category":"","amount":1,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":null,"description":"This is the market for 'carbon monoxide', in the United States geography for direct consumption. This product is generally considered an intermediate product and as such expected to be used at or in the vicinity of the production site."}]}
