[2025-11-19 21:19:48] Datos recibidos: {"General information":{"UUID":"ef869ae1-d59d-4eb3-be2a-6848f253cda7","Name":"washing machine production","Category":"Manufactura\/2750 Manufacture of domestic appliances","Description":"Esta actividad representa la producci\u00f3n y disposici\u00f3n de una lavadora promedio de 75 kg de masa. Tiene una vida \u00fatil prevista de 10 a\u00f1os y se fabrica en China. Las cifras sobre los insumos de materiales de la tecnosfera y la electricidad necesaria para producir una lavadora promedio se tomaron de Yuan et al. 2016. La cifra sobre el volumen de producci\u00f3n anual se estima mediante escalado del PIB. Esto se basa en la cantidad anual de ventas de lavadoras en la UE tomada de Michel et al. 2015. Las actividades incluidas comienzan con la recepci\u00f3n de materiales en la f\u00e1brica. La actividad incluye los procesos de uso de materiales y energ\u00eda en la fabricaci\u00f3n de una lavadora promedio. El inventario adicionalmente contabiliza la disposici\u00f3n de todos los materiales. El embalaje no est\u00e1 incluido.","Tags":"manufactura, electrodom\u00e9sticos, lavadoras, ciclo de vida, producci\u00f3n industrial","Technology | Description":"La actividad representa la producci\u00f3n y disposici\u00f3n de una lavadora promedio que es de 75 kg en masa. Tiene la vida \u00fatil prevista de 10 a\u00f1os y se fabrica en China. Las fuentes literarias utilizadas se refieren a la fabricaci\u00f3n en China. Los datos de fabricaci\u00f3n se toman de Yuan et al. 2016. Los datos sobre el volumen de producci\u00f3n anual se toman de Michel et al. 2015.","Code":"CN","Last_change":"19\/11\/2025 21:16"},"location":{"error":"Datos no encontrados para c\u00f3digo: CN"},"processDocumentation":{"LCI method":"Allocation, cut-off system model","Process type":"Ordinary transforming activity","Modeling constants":"Washing machine mass: 75 kg, lifetime: 10 years, manufacturing location: China","Data source information":"Yuan et al. 2016 for material inputs and electricity; Michel et al. 2015 for annual production volume; Eurostat 2016 for GDP scaling","Data completeness":"Covers material and energy use in manufacturing and disposal of all materials; packaging not included","Data selection":"Includes all material inputs, energy consumption, and waste outputs from washing machine production; excludes packaging materials","Data treatment":"Annual production volume estimated via GDP scaling from EU sales data to global production","Sampling procedure":"Manufacturing data from Yuan et al. 2016; production volume data from Michel et al. 2015","Data collection period":"2004-01-01 to 2024-12-31 (primary data from 2004)","Use advice":"Represents average washing machine production; technology based on Chinese manufacturing; valid for entire 2004-2024 period","Completeness":"Comprehensive coverage of manufacturing process from material reception to final product including disposal","Sources":"Yuan, Z., Zhang, Y., and Liu, X., 2016. Life cycle assessment of horizontal-axis washing machines in China. International Journal of Life Cycle Assessment, 21, 15-28. Michel, A., Josephy, B., Bush, E., et al. 2015. Monitoring the washing machines market in Europe. Discussion paper. Eurostat 2016. The EU in the world - economy and finance.","Project":"Not specified","Intended application":"Life cycle assessment studies of washing machines and related products","Data set owner":"ecoinvent Association","Data set generator":"Viachaslau Filimonau","Data set documentor":"Viachaslau Filimonau","Publication":"ecoinvent 3.11 database","Creation date":"Not specified","Copyright":"Copyright ecoinvent Association, 2025","Access and use restrictions":"Restrictions of use stipulated in the EULA remain applicable"},"actors":{"@id":"47a88430-1dd2-4569-9741-8249a6672ae2","name":"IINGEN-UNAM","description":"Instituto de Ingenier\u00eda de la UNAM","category":"Organizaciones de investigaci\u00f3n","version":"01.00.000","lastChange":"2025-11-19T21: