[2025-11-23 20:47:44] Datos recibidos: {"General information":{"UUID":"4fe99951-57e1-4fc6-b5c2-8dc69de7e300","Name":"market for carbon monoxide","Category":"Manufactura\/3251 Fabricaci\u00f3n de productos qu\u00edmicos b\u00e1sicos","Description":"Esta es una actividad de mercado que representa la mezcla de consumo de mon\u00f3xido de carbono en la geograf\u00eda de Estados Unidos. El mercado conecta a los proveedores con los consumidores del mismo producto en la misma \u00e1rea geogr\u00e1fica. Los mercados agrupan a los productores y tambi\u00e9n a las importaciones del producto (si es relevante) dentro de la misma \u00e1rea geogr\u00e1fica. Tambi\u00e9n tienen en cuenta el transporte al consumidor y las p\u00e9rdidas durante ese proceso, cuando es relevante. Este producto generalmente se considera un producto intermedio y, como tal, se espera que se utilice en el sitio de producci\u00f3n o en sus inmediaciones. La actividad comienza con el producto que sale del sitio de producci\u00f3n y termina con el producto que llega al usuario. Como este producto generalmente se considera que se utiliza en o en las inmediaciones del sitio de producci\u00f3n, no se incluyen requisitos de transporte.","Tags":"mercado, mon\u00f3xido de carbono, productos qu\u00edmicos b\u00e1sicos, sustancias inorg\u00e1nicas, productos intermedios","Technology | Description":"El mon\u00f3xido de carbono es una sustancia inorg\u00e1nica con CAS no.: 000630-08-0. Se llama 'mon\u00f3xido de carbono' bajo la nomenclatura IUPAC y su f\u00f3rmula molecular es: CO. Es un gas en condiciones normales de temperatura y presi\u00f3n sin olor distintivo. Se modela como una sustancia pura. A nivel de consumidor, se utiliza en los siguientes productos: productos qu\u00edmicos de laboratorio, combustibles, productos para el tratamiento de superficies met\u00e1licas, pol\u00edmeros y semiconductores.","Code":"US","Last_change":"23\/11\/2025 20:46"},"location":{"@type":"Location","@id":"0b3b97fa-6688-3c56-88ee-4ae80ec0c3c2","name":"United States","description":"reference location, sources: ISO 3166-1, ecoinvent 3, ILCD, GaBi","version":"00.00.000","code":"US","latitude":39.622,"longitude":-98.606},"processDocumentation":{"LCI method":"Allocation, cut-off system model","Process type":"Market activity","Modeling constants":"Product is modelled as a pure substance; considered an intermediate product expected to be used at or in vicinity of production site","Data source information":"ecoinvent 3.11 database","Data completeness":"Complete coverage of market mix for carbon monoxide in US geography","Data selection":"Includes all suppliers and imports of carbon monoxide within US geographical area; excludes transport requirements as product used on or near production site","Data treatment":"Market activity grouping producers and imports, accounting for consumption mix","Sampling procedure":"Not specified","Data collection period":"2011-01-01 to 2024-12-31","Use advice":"Valid for entire time period 2011-2024; product generally considered intermediate and used at\/near production site","Completeness":"Complete for market representation of carbon monoxide consumption mix in US","Sources":"ecoinvent Association","Project":"ecoinvent database","Intended application":"Life cycle assessment studies","Data set owner":"ecoinvent Association","Data set generator":"lasonas loannou","Data set documentor":"lasonas loannou","Publication":"ecoinvent 3.11 database documentation","Creation date":"2025","Copyright":"Copyright ecoinvent Association, 2025","Access and use restrictions":"Restrictions stipulated in EULA apply"},"actors":{"@id":"47a88430-1dd2-4569-9741-8249a6672ae2","name":"IINGEN-UNAM","description":"Instituto de Ingenier\u00eda de la UNAM","category":"Organizaciones de investigaci\u00f3n","version":"01.00.000","lastChange":"2025-11-23T20:47:13.598Z","address":"Circuito Escolar s\/n, Ciudad Universitaria","city":"Coyoac\u00e1n","zipCode":"04510","country":"MX","email":"APadillaR@iingen.unam.mx","telephone":"+52 5556233600","telefax":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.iingen.unam.mx"},"Inputs":[{"is_reference":false,"flow":"carbon monoxide","category":"","amount":0.5,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"","provider":"carbon monoxide production, from synthesis gas, through absorption US - carbon monoxide","description":""},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"carbon monoxide","category":"","amount":0.5,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"","provider":"carbon monoxide production, from synthesis gas, through cryogenic separation US - carbon monoxide","description":""}],"Outputs":[{"is_reference":true,"flow":"carbon monoxide","category":"","amount":1,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":null,"description":null}]}
