[2025-11-24 04:20:06] Datos recibidos: {"General information":{"UUID":"e0f92e91-7a89-4b76-9c8e-eb8caef1da34","Name":"washing machine production","Category":"Manufactura\/2750 Manufacture of domestic appliances","Description":"Esta actividad representa la producci\u00f3n y eliminaci\u00f3n de una lavadora promedio de 75 kg de masa con una vida \u00fatil prevista de 10 a\u00f1os fabricada en China. Las actividades incluidas comienzan con la recepci\u00f3n de materiales en la f\u00e1brica e incluyen los procesos de uso de materiales y energ\u00eda en la fabricaci\u00f3n de una lavadora promedio. El inventario adicionalmente contabiliza la eliminaci\u00f3n de todos los materiales. El embalaje no est\u00e1 incluido. Los datos de fabricaci\u00f3n se toman de Yuan et al. 2016 y los datos sobre el volumen de producci\u00f3n anual se toman de Michel et al. 2015.","Tags":"lavadora, electrodom\u00e9stico, producci\u00f3n manufacturera, evaluaci\u00f3n del ciclo de vida","Technology | Description":"The literature sources used refer to manufacturing in China. The background study utilised in this project (Yuan et al. 2016) refers to technology described as being 'current'.","Code":"CN","Last_change":"24\/11\/2025 04:16"},"location":{"error":"Datos no encontrados para c\u00f3digo: CN"},"processDocumentation":{"LCI method":"Allocation, cut-off system model","Process type":"Ordinary transforming activity","Modeling constants":"Average washing machine mass of 75 kg, envisaged lifetime of 10 years, manufactured in China","Data source information":"Yuan et al. 2016 for material inputs and electricity; Michel et al. 2015 for annual production volume via GDP scaling","Data completeness":"Covers material and energy use in manufacturing and disposal of all materials, packaging not included","Data selection":"Includes material inputs from technosphere, electricity consumption, and waste streams; based on horizontal-axis washing machines in China","Data treatment":"Annual world production v