[2025-11-27 21:12:00] Datos recibidos: {"General information":{"UUID":"1d35f97a-23ef-492a-b2d6-a0503bf68034","Name":"market for natural gas liquids","Category":"Utilities\/221 Utilities","Description":"This is a market activity representing the consumption mix of natural gas liquids in the Global geography. The market connects suppliers with consumers of the same product in the same geographical area, grouping producers and imports within the geographical area. The activity starts at the gate of the activities that produce 'natural gas liquids' within the Global geography and ends with the supply of natural gas liquids to consumers. Transport or losses are considered irrelevant for this product. Natural gas liquids is a fossil fuel with a calorific value of 24.624 MJ\/kg used as a liquid fuel sourced from unprocessed natural gas, with main applications in domestic fuel for cooking and heating, industrial fuel and plastics raw material.","Tags":"market activity, natural gas liquids, fossil fuel, energy market, global supply chain","Technology | Description":"Market activity technology representing the aggregation and distribution system for natural gas liquids. The technology groups multiple producers and imports of natural gas liquids within the Global geography and connects them with consumers without additional transport or loss considerations.","Code":"GLO","Last_change":"27\/11\/2025 21:10"},"location":{"@type":"Location","@id":"56bca136-90bb-3a77-9abb-7ce558af711e","name":"Global","description":"reference location, sources:  ecoinvent 3, ILCD, GaBi","version":"00.00.000","code":"GLO","latitude":0,"longitude":0},"processDocumentation":{"LCI method":"Allocation, cut-off system model","Process type":"Market activity","Modeling constants":"Market represents consumption mix of a product in given geography, connecting suppliers with consumers","Data source information":"ecoinvent database v3.11","Data completeness":"Complete coverage of all relevant flows for natural gas liquids market in Global geography","Data selection":"Includes all producers and imports of natural gas liquids within Global geography","Data treatment":"System-generated data with allocation based on cut-off approach","Sampling procedure":"Not specified","Data collection period":"2000-01-01 to 2024-12-31","Use advice":"Valid for entire period 2000-2024; no transport or losses considered as irrelevant for this product","Completeness":"Complete dataset covering all relevant inputs and outputs for market activity","Sources":"ecoinvent Association","Project":"ecoinvent database","Intended application":"Life cycle assessment studies for products and processes using natural gas liquids","Data set owner":"ecoinvent Association","Data set generator":"[System]","Data set documentor":"[System]","Publication":"ecoinvent 3.11 Database","Creation date":"2025","Copyright":"Copyright ecoinvent Association, 2025","Access and use restrictions":"Restrictions of use stipulated in the EULA remain applicable"},"actors":{"@id":"47a88430-1dd2-4569-9741-8249a6672ae2","name":"IINGEN-UNAM","description":"Instituto de Ingenier\u00eda de la UNAM","category":"Organizaciones de investigaci\u00f3n","version":"01.00.000","lastChange":"2025-11-27T21:11:06.813Z","address":"Circuito Escolar s\/n, Ciudad Universitaria","city":"Coyoac\u00e1n","zipCode":"04510","country":"MX","email":"APadillaR@iingen.unam.mx","telephone":"+52 5556233600","telefax":null,"website":"http:\/\/www.iingen.unam.mx"},"Inputs":[{"is_reference":false,"flow":"natural gas liquids","category":"","amount":1,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"","provider":"natural gas liquids production GLO - natural gas liquids","description":"This is a market activity for 'natural gas liquids' in the Global geography. This market contains no transport or losses, as they are irrelevant for the delivered product. The activity starts at the gate of the activities that produce 'natural gas liquids' within the geography of Global and ends with the supply