,"description":"Residuo de papel (billete y merma) enviado a disposici\u00f3n final (relleno sanitario)."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"Molienda de billete de pol\u00edmero (residuo)","category":"E:Water supply; sewerage, waste management and remediation activities\/562:Waste Treatment and Disposal","amount":286933.75,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":false,"provider":null,"description":"Residuo de polipropileno (billete y merma) enviado a disposici\u00f3n final (relleno sanitario)."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"Residuos s\u00f3lidos municipales","category":"E:Water supply; sewerage, waste management and remediation activities\/562:Waste Treatment and Disposal","amount":187441.62,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":false,"provider":null,"description":"Suma de residuos de varios m\u00f3dulos, principalmente del comedor y oficinas."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"Lodos","category":"E:Water supply; sewerage, waste management and remediation activities\/562:Waste Treatment and Disposal","amount":213271.84,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":false,"provider":null,"description":"Suma de lodos de producci\u00f3n de papel y lodos de digesti\u00f3n de varios m\u00f3dulos."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"Metal ferroso (residuo)","category":"E:Water supply; sewerage, waste management and remediation activities\/562:Waste Treatment and Disposal","amount":181216.51,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":false,"provider":null,"description":"Residuo met\u00e1lico de procesos de manufactura y mantenimiento."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"DBO (Demanda Biol\u00f3gica de Ox\u00edgeno)","category":null,"amount":3.48,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":false,"provider":null,"description":"Descarga al agua. Suma de varios m\u00f3dulos."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"\u00d3xidos de nitr\u00f3geno","category":null,"amount":205.1,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":false,"provider":null,"description":"Emisi\u00f3n al aire. Suma de varios m