uilding materials\/2332:Manufacture of bricks, tiles and construction products, in baked clay","amount":0.0002,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":"AP-42","description":"Emisi\u00f3n al aire."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"COV's","category":"C:Manufacturing\/23:Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products\/233:Manufacture of clay building materials\/2332:Manufacture of bricks, tiles and construction products, in baked clay","amount":1.1e-5,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":"AP-42","description":"Emisi\u00f3n al aire (Compuestos Org\u00e1nicos Vol\u00e1tiles)."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"CO2","category":"C:Manufacturing\/23:Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products\/233:Manufacture of clay building materials\/2332:Manufacture of bricks, tiles and construction products, in baked clay","amount":0.212327,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":"AP-42","description":"Emisi\u00f3n al aire (Di\u00f3xido de carbono)."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"CO","category":"C:Manufacturing\/23:Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products\/233:Manufacture of clay building materials\/2332:Manufacture of bricks, tiles and construction products, in baked clay","amount":0.0005,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":"AP-42","description":"Emisi\u00f3n al aire (Mon\u00f3xido de carbono)."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"Plomo","category":"C:Manufacturing\/23:Manufacture of other non-metallic mineral products\/233:Manufacture of clay building materials\/2332:Manufacture of bricks, tiles and construction products, in baked clay","amount":6.8e-8,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":null,"is_avoided":null,"provider":"AP-42","description":"Emisi\u00f3n al aire (Lead)."}]}
