stance was assumed to be 2 km (proxy)."},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"urea","category":"C:Manufacturing\/325:Chemical Manufacturing\/3253:Pesticide, Fertilizer, and Other Agricultural Chemical Manufacturing\/325311:Nitrogenous Fertilizer Manufacturing","amount":0.00146,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"lognormal","provider":"ecoinvent","description":"Calculated based on literature values: The nutrient content of the crop multiplied by the country-share of the fertiliser type (IFA 2014). Corresponds to 9.37 kg\/ha"},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"manure, liquid, cattle","category":"A:Agriculture, Forestry, Fishing and Hunting\/112:Animal Production and Aquaculture\/1121:Cattle Ranching and Farming","amount":0.0569,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"lognormal","provider":"ecoinvent","description":"Calculated based on literature values: The total amount of manure multiplied by the country-share of manure per animal category (FAOSTAT 2015). Corresponds to 0.785 m3\/ha"},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"manure, liquid, swine","category":"A:Agriculture, Forestry, Fishing and Hunting\/112:Animal Production and Aquaculture\/1122:Hog and Pig Farming","amount":0.0567,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"lognormal","provider":"ecoinvent","description":"Calculated based on literature values: The total amount of manure multiplied by the country-share of manure per animal category (FAOSTAT 2015). Corresponds to 0.781 m3\/ha"},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"manure, solid, cattle","category":"A:Agriculture, Forestry, Fishing and Hunting\/112:Animal Production and Aquaculture\/1121:Cattle Ranching and Farming","amount":0.0346,"unit":"kg","uncertainty":"lognormal","provider":"ecoinvent","description":"Calculated based on literature values: The total amount of manure multiplied by the country-share of manure per animal category (FAOSTAT 2015). Corresponds to 477.0 kg\/ha"},{"is_reference":false,"flow":"poultry manure, dried","category":"A:Agriculture, Forestry, Fishing and Hunting\/112:Animal Production and Aquac